TG-1 (invented): 2 SMs x 4 resident blocks = 8 slots
grid   4 blocks, 8 slots: finished after 4 steps
grid   8 blocks, 8 slots: finished after 4 steps
grid   9 blocks, 8 slots: HANG at step 4: 8 blocks spin at the barrier, 1 block(s) never got a slot (arrived 8 of 9)
grid  16 blocks, 8 slots: HANG at step 4: 8 blocks spin at the barrier, 8 block(s) never got a slot (arrived 8 of 16)
grid  64 blocks, 8 slots: HANG at step 4: 8 blocks spin at the barrier, 56 block(s) never got a slot (arrived 8 of 64)
cooperative-launch rule: grid <= blocks per SM x SMs = 8
